{
  "id": "aging-in-place",
  "term": "aging in place",
  "definition": "Aging in place means continuing to live at home in later life while receiving the social care and support needed there. In this context, it emphasizes adapting home-based services to the preferences and needs of older people, including those living with dementia, so they can maintain equality, participation, and dignity.",
